        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/{size}/4849_2.png",
        "created_at": "2025-02-12T16:40:39.285Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Back during the OblivAeon kickstarter GTG did make a few desktop wallpapers:<br>\n<a class=\"attachment\" href=\"/uploads/short-url/18UdDrYu2wA0YdKzLqqbZaAoyZt.zip\">OblivAeon Desktop Backgrounds-20250212T163255Z-001.zip</a> (9.4 MB)<br>\n(I myself have used that big “all the heroes versus all the villains” one for a time.)</p>\n<p>In addition, Adam — the artist of practically everything Sentinel Comics — operates an online store that you can buy digital files or physical art pieces from: <a href=\"https://www.atomicinkstudio.com/shop/sentinels\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Sentinels — Shop — Atomic Ink Studio | Comic book style pop culture goods</a></p>\n<p>The Sentinels wiki also has all of the Letters Page episode comic covers (and some other arts) up on it: <a href=\"https://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Category:Comic_Covers#tab=Letters_Page_Covers\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Category:Comic Covers - Sentinel Comics Wiki</a></p>",
